    {
      "paragraph_id": "rashomon-stories-p01369",
      "unit_index": 1,
      "source_text": "她满面红光，就像晨光照耀下的薄冰一样。",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "Her face was flushed, like thin ice shining in the morning light.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "rashomon-stories-p01369",
      "unit_index": 2,
      "source_text": "他对她持有好感，但是并没有恋爱。",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "He felt affection for her, but he was not in love.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "rashomon-stories-p01369",
      "unit_index": 3,
      "source_text": "而且一根手指头也没碰过她。",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "And he had never laid even a finger on her.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
